# 🚀 Ethos AI — Service Run Commands & Cheatsheet

This file contains all terminal commands to run the Frontend (Next.js), AI Microservice (FastAPI), and Prisma Studio (Prisma UI for Database) locally.
For formatted viewing in Markdown readers, see commands.md.

================================================================================
QUICK REFERENCE SUMMARY
================================================================================
- Frontend (Next.js):        http://localhost:3000        (Directory: apps/web)
- AI Microservice (FastAPI): http://localhost:8001        (Directory: apps/ai-service)
  Swagger API Docs:          http://localhost:8001/docs
  Health Check:              http://localhost:8001/health
- Prisma Studio (DB UI):     http://localhost:5555        (Directory: Project Root)

================================================================================
1. FRONTEND (Next.js 15)
================================================================================
From apps/web:
    cd apps/web
    npm run dev

Or directly from repository root:
    npm --prefix apps/web run dev

First-time dependency install:
    cd apps/web
    npm install

Production build & start:
    cd apps/web
    npm run build
    npm run start

================================================================================
2. AI MICROSERVICE (FastAPI + Uvicorn)
================================================================================
Windows PowerShell (Recommended):
    cd apps/ai-service
    .\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
    uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8001

Windows (Direct execution without activating venv):
    cd apps/ai-service
    .\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8001

One-liner from repository root:
    .\apps\ai-service\.venv\Scripts\uvicorn.exe app.main:app --app-dir apps/ai-service --reload --port 8001

Windows Command Prompt (cmd.exe):
    cd apps\ai-service
    .\.venv\Scripts\activate.bat
    uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8001

Linux / macOS (Bash):
    cd apps/ai-service
    source .venv/bin/activate
    uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8001

Run Tests:
    cd apps/ai-service
    .\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
    pytest

================================================================================
3. PRISMA STUDIO ("Prism UI" for Database)
================================================================================
Launch Prisma visual interface (Run from Project Root):
    npx prisma studio

Open in browser:
    http://localhost:5555

Custom port (if port 5555 is busy):
    npx prisma studio --port 5556

Helpful database companion commands (Run from Project Root):
    npx prisma generate
    npx prisma db push
    npx prisma migrate dev --name <migration_name>
    npx prisma migrate status
    npx prisma format
    npx ts-node prisma/seed.ts

================================================================================
4. RUNNING ALL 3 SERVICES TOGETHER (3 TERMINALS)
================================================================================
Terminal 1 (Frontend):
    cd apps/web
    npm run dev

Terminal 2 (AI Microservice):
    cd apps/ai-service
    .\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
    uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8001

Terminal 3 (Prisma Studio):
    npx prisma studio

